  "features": [
    "Glass panels, ceramic jugs and magnetic metal cans with distinct persistent debris and procedural sounds",
    "Contact-driven press crusher, spring launcher and spinning sweeper with shared GPU collider/paint poses",
    "Three armed finite-pool demonstrations; native Start, X power and compound press removal",
    "Wet debris slides farther and conservatively displaces film; vacuum preserves fragment materials",
    "K kick and U shove with cancellable windup, shared cooldown, no direct joint cutting, standing brace and injured-leg gait",
    "Opaque visibility pass retains socket/alpha coverage and original LTC/paint quality",
    "Ordered live collider/receiver indices are shared across physics samples; paint receiver lookup uses contiguous tile allocation binary search"
